  "prefLabel": "Den 103.01 Record of Official Actions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Den 103.01 Record of Official Actions. Minutes shall be kept of all board meetings and all official actions taken by the board. These minutes shall record those members who participate in each vote and shall separately record the position of any members who choose to dissent, abstain, or concur. Board minutes shall be public records and shall be available for inspection during the OPLC’s ordinary office hours within 5 business days of the date of the meeting or the vote in question.\n\nSource. #6908, eff 12-9-98; ss by #14140, eff 1-31-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/den100-500.html"
